title: '[pallet-broker] introduce Market trait for a generic coretime market'
doc:
- audience: Runtime User
  description: |-
    Introduce a market trait that will streamline the RFC-17 implementation 
    and will help to split the pallet-broker logic into independent parts.

    The pupose of this trait is to be implemented by a pallet containing the
    logic for RFC-17 market and be exposed as a configuration item in pallet-broker.
crates:
- name: pallet-broker
  bump: minor